note: Fitted on the fit window alone; each step of the test is priced from its own inputs (rate, prompt and output lengths, the replicas each role served) and never from its measured latency.
note: Each step's rate is the mean of its cycles' rates; its measured figures average the cycles' histograms, each over the source's rate window, so a step's measurement reaches back that window before the step. A percentile is scored with 50 requests or more at p50, 100 at p90 and 200 at p95 (50 for the mean).
note: Bias is the median of predicted over measured; error the median and p90 of |ln ratio| as a share; coverage the share of steps measured at or under the prediction's upper bound (the top of its span over V_P and f for TTFT, of its band for TPOT); within, the share inside 20%.
note: In region: the prediction is inside the validated envelope (docs/guides/capacity-planner/accuracy.md); all: every judged step.
